hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-8 : List Word
hyperactivity-is-the-theory-of-knowledge-graphs-8 = unlines (cons "Every major design (RDF and the semantic web stack, OWL and description logics, property graphs, Wikidata, the" (cons "industrial graphs of search engines, knowledge-graph embeddings, and lately retrieval layers built over language" (cons "models) delivers some of the five promises of a knowledge graph (identity, justification, composition, inference and currency) and patches the rest from outside. The patches are well known: reification and" (cons "RDF-star for statements about statements, named graphs for provenance, SHACL for constraints, `owl:sameAs` and" (cons "ontology-alignment systems for identity, materialization jobs for inference, and versioning schemes for change." (cons "Each patch adds a layer, and each layer has its own semantics, which the others don't respect." nil))))))
